# Evaluator-testing partition: contains official ground-truth .route files.
# Per Assessment and Plagiarism Policy (sec. 7, "Data Leakage and Evaluation
# Integrity"): evaluator-testing data must remain untouched during
# development, and organisers inspect repository history - so this must
# never be committed, even though data/raw/train and student_test are.
# It only needs to exist locally on Laptop 1's disk for the API to read it.
data/raw/evaluator_test/

